Earn an extra 20% free play no-rollover bonus on $400 or $500 deposits.

IMPORTANT:
You must send the following amounts which will ensure a quicker deposit to your account:
$25, $50, $100, $150, $200, $300, $400, $500. ANy other amounts will take longer to confirm and add to your account.

Step 1:
Purchase a retail card which can be found at major retailers. Most of these locations sell vanilla visa or mastercards that you can load with your desired amount at the cashier. 

For example locations include:
Safeway, Kroger, Publix, Whole Foods, 7-Eleven, CVS Pharmacy, Rite Aid, Walgreens, Best Buy, Barnes & Noble, and many others.

Most of these locations sell debit cards that you can load with your desired amount at the cashier. 

Also, you can  purchase a card which will be delivered instantly via email, text, or a shareable link. For example:
The cards can be purchased directly from VanillaGift.com, eGifter.com, Amazon.com and 
Walmart.com

IMPORTANT: It must be a Vanilla Visa or Vanilla Mastercard. Take the card to the register and fund it with the desired amount from the list above.

We suggest a GOOGLE SEARCH of "Vanilla Visa/Mastercard retail outlets" or "Vanilla Visa/Mastercard online purchase" to find your nearest reatil location or online provider. 

Step 2:
Return to this page and fill in all the info below and click ''Submit Deposit Request'' at the bottom. Your deposit will be confirmed and added to your account with the bonus that correlates to the amount sent.

