The steps below are detailed and that is the reason it may seem like a long list. However, it is a very quick process you can do from home rather than traveling to a location. Use the steps below if you are unsure how to complete the process.

Step 1:
Click the link below to receive a destination country, receiver name and amount from the link below. 

Step 2:
Login or create a new Remitly account online at http://www.remitly.com or download the Remitly app. 

Step 3:
Click ''Send Money'' in the top menu.

Step 4:
Choose the country you want to send the funds that you received from the link below.

Step 5:
Click  ''Send to new recipient''.

Step 6:
Choose the amount you wish to send and your payment method (credit card, debit card or bank account).

IMPORTANT: LImits may vary depending on your account at Remitly. We accept a minimum of $100 and a maximum of $3000 per transaction.

IMPORTANT: Debit Card is express delivery and we will add the funds quicker to your account. Credit Card and Bank Account does take longer.

Step 7:
Click ''Cash Pickup'' as the delivery method.

Step 8:
Click the ''Cash Pickup'' option from the one showing.

Step 9:
Add the recipient first and last name that you received from the link below.

Step 10:
Add the recipient location information that you received from the link below.

Step 11:
Click ''Skip'' as the option on recipient notification. 

Step 12:
Add your sender details (first name, last name and date of birth)

Step 13:
Confirm your sender information on the pop-up.

Step 14:
Add your sender information (street address, city, state and zip code)

Step 15:
Add your sender phone number.

Step 16:
Click your payment method (Add New Card or Add Bank Account).

IMPORTANT: Debit Card is express delivery and we will add the funds quicker to your account. Credit Card and Bank Account does take longer (up to 3 days). If you are an existing longterm customer with us we will make exceptions and add sooner).

Step 17:
Add your credit card or bank account information.

Step 18:
Click ''Continue'' on the Extra Fees Apply pop-up.

Step 19:
Review all the information and click ''Send'' at the bottom if all is correct. 

If the info is not correct you have the option to edit anything that is incorrect or could delay your payment.

Step 20:
Return to this page and fill in all the info below including the cinfirmation/reference number which will show on the last page after you send as well as by email and click ''Submit Deposit Request'' at the bottom. Your deposit will be confirmed and added to your account with the bonus that correlates to the amount sent.

IMPORTANT:
In the "Fees" field add the amount it cost you to purchase the card. We will re-imbuirse this amount as a free play to your account.', 'hidden_label', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-02T14:37:28.109Z', '2026-04-02T14:37:28.109Z', NULL);

Step 1:
Login to your bitcoin wallett or open a new wallett and fund your account.

Bitcoin wallets/exchanges that you can use include but are not limited to:
Coinbase.com
Crypto.com
Kraken.com
Blockchain.com
Binace.com

You can also buy bitcoin through CashApp:
https://www.youtube.com/shorts/Cg0z4kqO3Co

If you are not familiar with bitcoin and how it works please check our tutorial at the link below or call/email the office to speak with a representative.

https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3QH7ZTibV-Q&t=16s

Also, we suggest a GOOGLE SEARCH on "How to buy bitcoin" for more information.

Step 2:
Click on the ''BITCOIN RECEIVER ADDRESS'' button below to get an address from us to send your desired amount once you have funded your bitcoin wallett. 

Step 3:
Paste the addresss you get below into the ''Send'' option in your wallett and decide how much you wish  to send.

Step 4:
Return to this page and fill in all the info below and click ''Submit Deposit Request'' at the bottom. Your deposit will be confirmed and added to your account with the bonus that correlates to the amount sent. 

We will convert the amount you send in bitcoins to the dollar amount it was valued at when received. The dollar amount we use is decided by the exchange Binance.com.

IMPORTANT:
In the "Fees" field add the amount it cost you to purchase the card. We will re-imbuirse this amount as a free play to your account.', 'hidden_label', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-02T18:44:03.302Z', '2026-04-02T18:44:03.302Z', NULL);

